-- The 19 existing basic-cover clients also open the shared AffineTests.localised constructor by definition.
-- Reviewed essential-image foundations, one opening list per declaration.
-- See source proof headers and DESIGN.md: pointwise functors and lattices,
-- Yoneda, compact-open realisation, basic cover diagrams, sheaf descent,
-- affine basic opens and finite compatible-tuple limits.
-- Construction boundaries: ZariskiFunctor.OnMap.lattice-map is opaque.
